Source of truth: `FILTERS.md`. Agent workflow: `AGENTS.md`. Read both before evaluating any listing. Check `listings/rejected.md` first.

Hard filters (condensed — FILTERS.md wins on conflict):
- R-BUDGET: asking €80k–159k; above €159k or below €80k excluded immediately. WHITE VARIANT: asking ≤€90k (>€90k FAIL even if <€159k); unknown finish = MAYBE (2026-11-17).
- R-BANDS: ONE single price band: €80k–159k inclusive (2026-11-21). QUOTAS: PASS ≤10, MAYBE separate status ≤10 TOTAL (own quota, does NOT consume PASS quota).
- MAYBE PUBLICATION: MAYBE now PUBLISHED with literal tag and specific reasons (e.g. year unverified — must confirm ≥2000). PASS = fully verified; MAYBE = unknown/contradictory but no confirmed violation; FAIL = confirmed violation, excluded. Include all material unknowns, required verification, never fabricate. Unknown year may publish as MAYBE; known <2000 FAIL (unless Stalinka/102).
- R-TYPE/R-AREA/R-LAYOUT: any number of rooms; total area ≥55 m² (known <55 m² = FAIL; unknown = MAYBE); R-PRICE-M2: ≤€2,200/m² (2026-11-20; was €2,100); own kitchen, bath, hallway, no walk-through rooms.
- R-YEAR: construction year ≥2000 (buildings before 2000 excluded; renovation doesn't count; unverified year = MAYBE). EXCEPTION (2026-11-18 23:18): Stalinka, seria 102 (cotileț), seria 143, Czech series/project (чешский проект / proiect cehesc), and individual projects (индивидуальный проект / proiect individual) allowed even if pre-2000, only when explicitly confirmed in listing; unconfirmed = MAYBE; other pre-2000 series (135, MS/Varnița, brejnevka, hrușciovka, etc.) = FAIL.
- R-FLOOR: apartments floors 2–8 only; single-storey houses exception. R-TOPFLOOR: top floor flagged.
- R-LIFT: informational only; high floor without lift flagged but NEVER excluded.
- R-MANSARD/R-HOUSE: mansards allowed (flag roof/legal/cadastral); single-storey houses allowed (flag legal/cadastral/land); exception to R-FLOOR/R-LIFT.
- R-EXCL-*: no hostel/gostinka, soclu/demisol/pe sol, grey variant (white variant allowed ≤€90k, add renovation estimate), uncommissioned new build, suburbs (Durlești, Codru, Stăuceni, etc.; no exceptions); ignore promoted 999.md ads.
- R-LOC (2026-11-21): ONLY Centru (whole sector), whole Rîșcani sector EXCEPT Poșta Veche (Poșta Veche excluded; Rîșcanovca, Petricani, Cartierul Moldova/Socoleni, Studenților etc. allowed, but Ceucari and Braniștii blacklisted R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21), and Buiucani near Komsomol lake/Valea Morilor (~0–20 min walk including adjacent Buiucani). EVERYTHING ELSE EXCLUDED: Poșta Veche, other Buiucani, Telecentru, all Ciocana (incl. former Port Mall exception, revoked 2026-11-12), Botanica, suburbs. Unclear micro-district (e.g. only 'Rîșcani' without street/map) = MAYBE. + R-ALBA-IULIA (2026-11-21): whole str. Alba Iulia in Chișinău (incl. Sculeanca) is location-OK regardless of lake distance, but ALWAYS MAYBE at most (never PASS) with note «Алба Юлия — вне основной зоны (Скулянка/Буюканы)»; suburb Alba Iulia excluded.
- R-MICRO: ≤5–10 min walk to main road, park or university; R-LAKE 20-min priority overrides this.
- R-BLACKLIST (2026-11-21): Drumul Viilor (2026-11-13); Valea Dicescu (2026-11-15); Calea Ieșilor (2026-11-15); Grădinilor (2026-11-15); Pajurii (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Pajurii/Păjurii/Пажурий) (2026-11-21 21:00; was in East Rîșcani pocket 2026-11-01 to 2026-11-20, re-blacklisted); Ceucari (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Ceucari/Чеукарь) (2026-11-21 21:09); Braniștii (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Braniștii/Branistii/Брэништий/Браништий) (2026-11-21 21:09). East Rîșcani streets (Florării, Forăriei, Zimbrului) removed from blacklist 2026-11-20; Pajurii re-blacklisted 2026-11-21.
- R-CET1-INFO (2026-11-21): CET-1 zone exclusion REMOVED entirely. All addresses (Nicolae Dimo, Tudor Vladimirescu, Florării, Pajurii, Forăriei, Zimbrului, and ~800 m around CET-1) now evaluated by standard filters. CET-1 proximity flagged as informational only ("близко к ТЭЦ-1"), NOT exclusion. Must verify locality/address, not bare street name; unclear locality = MAYBE. Note: Pajurii blacklisted (R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21 21:00).

TELEGRAM POSTING (2026-11-20): Morning run (~09:00) with NO fresh PASS or MAYBE => post ONE short Russian message (nothing new + one-line filter summary €80–159k, ≥55 m², ≤€2200/m², floors 2–8, Rîșcani except Poșta Veche / Centru / Komsomol lake–Valea Morilor / whole str. Alba Iulia (MAYBE only) + coverage summary; honest if partial). NOT posted if run failed (failure → Grok Bot chat). Message adds nothing to posted_ids. Buffer runs (12:00/19:00) unchanged: empty buffer => no message.

Output: PASS/MAYBE/FAIL with rule IDs. Never invent numbers. Reply to Andrew in Russian. Update FILTERS.md + listings + CHANGELOG.md when rules change.
